{"sectionId":"solution/colligative","items":[{"id":"solution--colligative-k001","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"이상용액에서 Raoult 법칙 Pᵢ=xᵢPᵢ*가 성립한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k002","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"비휘발성 용질을 넣으면 용매의 증기압이 낮아진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k003","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"용질-용매 상호작용이 상대적으로 약하면 양의 편차, 강하면 음의 편차가 나타날 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k004","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"Henry 법칙은 묽은 기체 용액의 용해량과 기체 분압 사이 비례 관계이며 상수 정의에 따라 식 형태가 다르다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k005","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"실제 용액의 화학퍼텐셜은 활동도로 표현한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k006","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"묽은 이상용액에서 ΔTb=iKb m, ΔTf=iKf m, Π=iMRT이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k007","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"ΔTf는 어는점 내림의 양의 크기이며 실제 Tf=Tf°−ΔTf이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k008","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"i는 용질 입자 수 효과를 나타내는 van't Hoff 인자로 전해질 해리, 이온쌍 형성 등에 의해 달라질 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k009","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"총괄성은 이상적 묽은 조건에서 용질 종류보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k010","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"입자 농도에 의존한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k011","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"삼투압은 반투막을 통한 순수 용매 이동을 막기 위해 필요한 압력차다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k012","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"몰랄농도는 끓는점·어는점 변화, 몰농도는 묽은 삼투압 식에 사용.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k013","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"NaCl 완전해리 이상 근사 i≈2, CaCl₂는 i≈3.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k014","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"비이상 용액에서는 활동도 보정이 필요하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k015","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"온도 변화에 따라 몰농도는 부피 변화의 영향을 받을 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solution--colligative-k016","sectionId":"solution/colligative","unitId":"solution","subject":"chemistry","text":"CaCl₂로 이상 근사에서 약 3배이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}